## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests

Run all unit tests from the `fastapi_chatbot/` directory:

```bash
cd /home/dahmane/dev/Plateforme_NLP/fastapi_chatbot
python -m pytest tests/ -v
```

Individual test files:

```bash
# Memory intent classifier + regression tests
python -m pytest tests/test_memory_intents.py -v

# Evaluation metric tests
python -m pytest tests/test_evaluation_metrics.py -v

# Existing web confidence tests (regression)
python -m pytest tests/test_web_confidence.py -v
```

### Manual Verification

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The evaluation runner requires the Docker environment to be running (Qdrant, Postgres, Groq API). You should run it when you're ready to generate actual evaluation results for the report.

```bash
cd /home/dahmane/dev/Plateforme_NLP/fastapi_chatbot
python -m evaluation.runner --output reports/evaluation_report.json
```
